size=\"3\"><font color=\"#003300\"><strong></strong></font><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\" color=\"#000080\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><u>♣ 휴학시에는 납부한 등록금이 반환되지 않습니다.</u></strong></span></font></font></p><p><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\" color=\"#000000\"></font></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></span></span></font></p><p><font size=\"3\"><br><!--StartFragment--><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #7c43b1\"><font color=\"#ffffff\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 등록금 납부방법</span></strong>&nbsp; </font></font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;■ 은행에 직접 방문하여 납부할 경우</font></strong></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 고지서 지참(은행 영업시간 : 09시~16시)</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 등록금 납부금액이 \"0\"(전액면제자)인 경우에는 은행 직접 방문하여</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;등록절차(등록처리)를 이행하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span><br></font></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;■ 개인별 가상계좌번호로 등록금 납부/입금(</strong>인터넷뱅킹, 폰뱅킹 등 이용시)</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 받는 사람 이름을(학생본인이름) 필히 확인하세요.</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 보내는 사람은 학생이름이 아니라도 상관없습니다.</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(보호자 통장으로 이체 가능합니다.)</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 가상계좌번호는 매학기마다 변경될 수 있습니다.</span><br></font></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;■ <strong>“학생회비”를 납부하고자 할 경우 등록금과 합산하여 입금하세요</strong>.</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#ffffff\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #7c43b1\">&nbsp; 2. 등록금 납부제도 </font></span></strong>&nbsp;</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;■ 등록금 분할납부</font></strong></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 분할납부 : 등록금을 4회로 나누어 납부할 수 있는 제도입니다.</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 분할납부 신청방법 : 우편신청, 방문신청</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 자세한 <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">사항은 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><a style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" href=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/jsp/module/board/view01.do?conf_no=130&amp;board_no=3115&amp;group_no=-1&amp;up_geul_no=-1&amp;to_conf_no=&amp;delete_yn=0&amp;board_type=hm&amp;search_key=jemok&amp;keyword=%EB%B6%84%ED%95%A0&amp;totalCnt=24&amp;paging=10&amp;C_PAGE=1\" target=\"_blank\"><u><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">\"2012학년도 1학기 등록금 분할납부 안내\"</span></u></a></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; 참조해 </span></span>주세요.</span><br></font></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;■ 농협카드, 농협비씨카드로 등록금 납부</font></strong></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 연말정산시 신용카드 소득공제항목에서 제외됩니다.</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 카드사용 포인트가 적립되지 않습니다.</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 할부시 할부(이용)수수료가 발생됩니다.(할부수수료 9.8%)</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 등록금 분할납부를 신청한 경우 신용카드 납부가 되지 않습니다.</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 신용카드와 고지서를 지참하여 은행을 직접 방문하여 납부 가능하며,</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 농협 홈페이지 금융상품몰(대학생전용몰)을 이용하여 납부가능합니다.</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #7c43b1\"><font color=\"#ffffff\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp; 3. 등록금 납부 확인 방법 및 등록금 납부확인서 발급</span></strong> </font></font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;■ 학교확인(최종확인)</strong> : 등록금을 납부한 다음날 10:00부터 확인 가능합니다.</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 원스톱서비스-학사관리-등록-등록금 납부/반환내역조회(납부확인서 발급)</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 2012학년도 1학기 등록금 납부확인서는 2012년 5월말까지 발급합니다.</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;■ 은행확인(중간확인)</strong> : 실시간 납부조회 가능합니다.</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 은행확인(중간확인) 후 학교확인(최종확인)을 하시기 바랍니다.</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"> </span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><a style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" href=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/jsp/module/board/view01.do?conf_no=130&amp;board_no=3131&amp;group_no=-1&amp;up_geul_no=-1&amp;to_conf_no=&amp;delete_yn=0&amp;board_type=hm&amp;search_key=jemok&amp;keyword=%ED%99%95%EC%9D%B8\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><u>등록금 납부 확인 사이트 바로가기</u><span></span></font></span></a></span></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><font color=\"#ffffff\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #7c43b1\">&nbsp; 4. 수업연한초과(학기초과) 등록자인 경우 </font>&nbsp;</font></span></strong></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;■ 수강신청 후 경리팀에 문의하여 주세요.(478-7115)</font></strong></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 원스톱서비스로 등록금 고지서 출력 가능합니다.</span><br></font></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;■ 학부 수업연한초과자 등록금</font></strong></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 1학점~3학점 : 등록금의 1/6</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 4학점~6학점 : 등록금의 1/3</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 7학점~9학점 : 등록금의 1/2</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 10학점 이상 : 전액</span><br></font></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;■ 대학원 수업연한초과자 등록금</font></strong></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 1학점~3학점 : 등록금의 1/2</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 4학점 이상 : 전액</font></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><font color=\"#ffffff\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #7c43b1\">&nbsp; 5. 2012학년도 1학기 장학금을 받는 경우 </font>&nbsp;</font></span></strong></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;■ 등록금을 납부하지 않을 경우 장학이 취소됩니다.</font></strong></span></font></p><